Hi everyone,

The audio dataset files are now available for download from our public Google Cloud Storage bucket:

https://storage.googleapis.com/fongbe/

The link displays an XML listing of all available files, including the test audio and training audio archives (reliable, religious and uncertain).

You can download all files using Python and the Google Cloud Storage library.

Alternatively, you can download individual files directly using their URLs.

Please note: Some archives are around 2 GB each, so ensure you have sufficient space and a stable internet connection before downloading.


